OL,3,GNEWSAThe centuries old-pub game created
OL,4,Aby bored children
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe unique activity is thought to have
OL,7,Fbeen played at the White Horse pub
OL,8,Fsince it opened in the early 18th
OL,9,Fcentury, after children sparked the
OL,10,Fidea for the game while waiting for
OL,11,Ftheir parents at church.
